abstract: >-
  The implementation of the paper "Universe24: an integer cellular automaton
  read through clicks, the formulas it shares with nature and the ones it adds"
  (Alon Gonen, 2026): a lattice of Nodes holding bounded integers, stepped by
  one rule, Rule3, from each Node's present, its past and its six neighbours,
  reversibly, and read only through the clicks of declared NodeDetectors. The engine holds no number of
  physics, no formula and no family's name; every physical value comes from
  the run's files, and every primitive is one folder found by its name. The
  paper's documents, files and scripts are in the repository.
